msgid ""
"Switch to _<branch>_. This sets the current branch to _<branch>_ and updates "
"the files in your working directory. The checkout will fail if there are "
"uncommitted changes to any files where _<branch>_ and your current commit "
"have different content. Uncommitted changes will otherwise be kept."
