"Replace the specified files and/or directories with the version from the "
"given commit or tree and add them to the index (also known as \"staging "
"area\")."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-checkout.adoc:84
msgid ""
"For example, `git checkout main file.txt` will replace `file.txt` with the "
"version from `main`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-checkout.adoc:85
